                <pb facs="0747" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1936v02/pg648"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/2291: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Then in France, to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">St.
                                Jean de Luz</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-07-27">undated</date>.]<lb/>[Received
                        July 27, 1936—3:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Since unable to communicate have proceeded St. Jean de Luz, France, Golf Hotel,
                    in order to confer with colleagues there. Shall return Fuenterrabia tomorrow and
                    spend part time in each. Send cables mail St. Jean. Request <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cayuga</hi> be kept my sole disposition. If necessary
                    transship cadets other ship at St. Jean.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
